{"articleNo":"2723","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2723&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011학년도 1학기 미래드림(기초수급) 장학금 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.02.07","hit":"14653","attachments":[{"name":"미래드림장학학생신청메뉴얼(2011-1학기).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2723&attachNo=2382"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"4\">2011학년도 1학기 미래드림(기초수급) 장학금 신청 안내</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><font size=\"4\"></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;<font size=\"3\">&nbsp;2011학년도 1학기 미래드림(기초수급 )장학금 신청을 아래와 같이 안내하<br><br>&nbsp; 니 해당 학생들은 기한내에 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br><br><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 우선감면 대상자의 장학금 신청<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 재단 홈페이지(</span></font><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">)에서 공인인증서로 로그인 후 신청<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제출서류 : 없음<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 우선감면 대상자 : </span></font><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">학생 본인이 재단 마이페이지에서도 확인 가능<br><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 우선감면 비대상자(신규신청)<br><br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 재단 홈페이지(</span></font><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)에서 공인인증서로 로그인 후 신청<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제출서류 : 신청서, 서약서, 수급자증명서&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (출력후 서명하여 학생처로 제출)<br><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">3. 공통사항<br><br></font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 지원금액 : 1학기 : 230만원(등록금 범위내)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 수혜자격 : 직전학기 취득학점 12학점이상, 평균평점 2.6이상<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;정규학기 이내(8개학기)<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 신청대상자 : </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011년 신입생 및 재학생, 복학생, 편입생</span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 신청기간 :<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 1차 : </font></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 01. 17(월) - 01. 28(금).<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 2차 : </span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 02. 07(월) - 03. 31(목).<br></span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br>4. 서류제출장소 : 학생처(본관101호)</span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;(등기접수가능 : 경북 구미시 양호동 1번지 금오공과대학교<br>&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;학생처(본관101호) </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #990000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">5.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 기타 궁금한 사항은 붙임 2011년 1학기 미래드림 장학금 신청 안내 메뉴<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 얼을 참고하시기 바랍니다.<br><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"><br>6. 문의 : 054-478-7045</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’\"></span><br><br></span></font></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-TOP: 37.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ccffff; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2011년 1월 17일<br></font><br><font size=\"4\">금오공과대학교 학생처장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
